<title>USA: Smith's Food Q1 oper profit before charge.</title>
<headline>Smith's Food Q1 oper profit before charge.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith's Food &amp; Drug Centers Inc</p>
<p>				   14 Weeks Ended	 13 Weeks Ended</p>
<p>				    April 5, 1997	 March 30, 1996</p>
<p> Net sales		   $831,821   100.00%  $693,165  100.00%</p>
