<p>(Dollar amounts in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: On May 23, 1996, Smith's completed its cquisition of Smitty's Supermarkets Inc, a 28-store Arizona supermarket chain and also recapitalized. Q1 1997 reflects the results of operations from the Smitty's stores.  As reported earlier, Smith's closed its California region comprised of 34 stores and a large distribution center during the first quarter of 1996.</p>
